#: includes/class-abilities.php:27
msgid "Server Health Audit"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:28
msgid ""
"Inspect PHP version, server configuration, extensions, and audit grade "
"collected by phpinfo() WP."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:32
msgid "Get PHP Version & EOL Status"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:33
msgid ""
"Returns the running PHP version, its end-of-life date, days remaining, and "
"an ok/warning/eol status flag."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:52
msgid "Get Config Grade"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:53
msgid ""
"Returns the overall A–F config grade, numeric score, and counts of passing/"
"warning/failing checks."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:73
msgid "List Failing Config Checks"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:74
msgid ""
"Returns each failing or warning config check with its directive key, current "
"value, recommended value, and severity. Pro-only — free tier returns an "
"empty list."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:98
msgid "Get PHP Directive Value"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:99
msgid ""
"Returns the current value of a named php.ini directive (e.g. memory_limit, "
"upload_max_filesize)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:122
msgid "List Loaded PHP Extensions"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:123
msgid ""
"Returns the names of all PHP extensions currently loaded on the server, "
"sorted alphabetically."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:136
msgid "Get Server Audit Summary"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:137
msgid ""
"Returns a high-level rollup of server health: PHP version, EOL status, "
"config grade, and counts of issues. The single best ability to call for a "
"\"how is my server doing\" check."
msgstr ""

